","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"该内容介绍如何通过 n8n 的社区节点 ，在可视化编辑器里直接使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore harness，快速为工作流添加具备持久记忆、工具调用和模型自由切换的 AI Agent。","title":"Run production AI agents in n8n with Amazon Bedrock AgentCore harness"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0a35f9d363a4901a9f53e04e89203a7f965680ca7089f9631ed99875abb1fd02","internal_url":"/posts/20260806-arxiv-argus-a-general-purpose-agentic-runtime-for-long-h-1-2cf5155ca9/","observation_id":"obs_2cf5155ca9444c932c4dc993f2b718bea076e6e1a79152ee06019150231a0cfb","published_at":"2026-08-05T17:58:58Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"Argus 是一种持续、自我进化的智能体运行时，采用 Manager、Planner、Engineer、Reviewer 四类角色在项目状态上进行有界任务执行。它将用户意图与具体目标、约束及验证条件分离，在模型权重保持不变的前提下通过持久化的运行时状态和控制策略实现自我演化。","title":"Argus: A General-Purpose Agentic Runtime for Long-Horizon Reasoning"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_fe2738fc7f35759fe0641cfd84148039e51dfcbcdf56c91a3c325e069fa2dac2","internal_url":"/posts/20260806-arxiv-toward-skill-native-llms-skill-entropy-for-benchma-1-7b6085fd24/","observation_id":"obs_7b6085fd248fee2308ff1b2e6cdb1b2dd150989f06adde5239ef0a2feb7bea43","published_at":"2026-08-05T17:57:16Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该内容提出一种量化推理过程中技能切换难度的指标，并在此基础上构建了包含跨技能长时推理任务的评测基准，同时将该指标转化为强化学习训练信号，用于提升模型在复杂推理链中的技能切换能力。","title":"Toward Skill-Native LLMs: Skill Entropy for Benchmarking and Training Long-Horizon Reasoning"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_2af9b98df4c93e46d21b78b907cf62234e7b6a1007e1b448ecb2769c5e5e580a","internal_url":"/posts/20260805-hacker_news-position-llms-cant-jump-0-7d703edcfc/","observation_id":"obs_7d703edcfc16cd09ee95dcc98a621a78c97406cfa0bfe7b542ec1c795401b96f","published_at":"2026-08-05T11:01:37Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Position: LLMs Can't Jump"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_18c791ca3a7fc3ad4c8f8fa0c24f24a